.TH BBCAT 1 "July 2026" "bbcat-gnome" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bbcat \- render ANSI and BBS artwork
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bbcat
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ FILE ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B bbcat
renders character art in the terminal, plays terminal animation, or writes
Kitty, PNG, APNG, and GIF images.
Input may be an artwork file, a ZIP art pack, or
.B \-
for standard input.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-width " " COLS
Override the text width.
.TP
.BR \-\-chunk-lines " " ROWS
Set the Kitty image height.
.TP
.B \-\-kitty
Use Kitty graphics instead of UTF-8 text.
.TP
.B \-\-fit
Scale complete Kitty art to terminal width instead of cropping.
.TP
.B \-\-slow
Reveal character art one row at a time.
.TP
.BR \-\-delay " " MS
Set the slow-mode row delay.
.TP
.BR \-\-baud " " RATE
Set animation or static row-reveal speed.
.TP
.B \-\-2x
Double Kitty or image output dimensions.
.TP
.B \-\-sauce
Show a SAUCE caption below the artwork.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " FILE
Write a PNG file, or
.B \-
for standard output.
.TP
.BR \-\-apng " " FILE
Write an animated PNG.
.TP
.BR \-\-gif " " FILE
Write an animated GIF.
.TP
.B \-\-asciimation
Play a 13-row asciimation.co.nz frame stream.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command help.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B bbcat artwork.ans
Render artwork in the terminal.
.TP
.B bbcat --output artwork.png artwork.ans
Export artwork as PNG.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://bbcat.dev/
